{"overview":"جیمی شیو‑اورلی، خودشیفته، سرسخت و خودتخریبی، فکر می‌کند همه روابط نابود می‌شوند؛ گرچن کاتلر، بدبین، خوشایند و سرسخت می‌داند که روابط برای او نیستند. وقتی در عروسی‌ای با هم ملاقات می‌کنند، طبیعی است که هر دو با هم به خانه بروند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Narcissistic, brash, and self-destructive Jimmy Shive-Overly thinks all relationships are doomed. Cynical, people-pleasing, and stubborn Gretchen Cutler knows that relationships aren't for her. So when they meet at a wedding, it's only natural that the two of them go home together.","tagline_en":"Terrible people. Perfect for each other.","runtime":26,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":10,"y":2014,"poster":"/Am4KK2SQLmarHmFCJKHVCqrJNgd.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":13,"y":2015,"poster":"/c7Ge8WbZKdOXQ50DA0c3A83sDet.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":13,"y":2016,"poster":"/nLUOKPIBnCpUs8g5BWLiI6UV2W6.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":13,"y":2017,"poster":"/kJAZKeCdNJshtaPxjdndOQP51Sp.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":13,"y":2019,"poster":"/3YpxoeQ2Jdwh9zrMctDQ6jAfEPR.jpg"}],"episodes":62,"crew":["Stephen Falk"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"کریس گیر","role":"Jimmy Shive-Overly","photo":"/y5Ti23z47KY0XG7lzSLxffB0QKn.jpg","en":"Chris Geere"},{"name":"Aya Cash","role":"Gretchen Cutler","photo":"/xUqelq0tht436iAahA4oLupSbK0.jpg"},{"name":"Desmin Borges","role":"Edgar Quintero","photo":"/9tF2giXqRiSJc2lkZG9R3G8FPjv.jpg"},{"name":"Kether Donohue","role":"Lindsay Jillian","photo":"/f1JMAIitNYTOYQCRgNtBGZYgaY1.jpg"}],"trailer":"4ao_jIEqRgg","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/61118-you-re-the-worst/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Hulu","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/44uAnmSqvA4yBOdbPWN8YgQHjWm.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"},{"n":"Google Play Movies","kind":"buy","logo":"/aZRENwYILujqs0RVOZutTh0BVGV.png"},{"n":"Fandango At Home","kind":"bu